{"src":"tr","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":192300,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"tr","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":8899.304392,"text":"Ulusal hazine filmini izlediyseniz bağımsızlık bildirgesinin arkasında bir hazine haritası çizilmiş olduğunu düşünebilirsiniz."},{"kind":"text","t":9858.713678999999,"text":"If you’ve watched the National Treasure movie, you might think that a map to a treasure is drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":9966.396535,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9971.937016,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":9977.780811999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9983.160656,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9988.812275999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9993.971082999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9996.111319,"samples":19392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":16147.887268,"text":"Sıcak çikolata Belçika standartlarındadır. Meyve suları pahalı fakat muhteşemdir."},{"kind":"text","t":16518.423265,"text":"The hot chocolate meets Belgian standards. Fruit juices are expensive but wonderful."},{"kind":"audio","t":16611.217559,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16616.273428,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":16618.106599000002,"samples":15464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"audio","t":16704.531565,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16709.592174,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16711.195408,"samples":16664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":110},{"kind":"input","t":23707.169909,"text":"Fakat bu doğru değil. Belgenin arka yüzünde yazılı bir şey bulunmasına rağmen bu bir hazine haritası değildir."},{"kind":"text","t":24430.199741,"text":"But that’s not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"audio","t":24517.336196,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24518.667464000002,"samples":16432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"audio","t":24603.974198,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24609.110026000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24614.211155,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24619.807665,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":24620.10565,"samples":5128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":33712.116767,"text":"Kendi hükümetiniz dışındaki hükümetlerin tavsiyelerine de danışabilirsiniz. Ancak onların tavsiyeleri kendi vatandaşlarına yöneliktir."},{"kind":"text","t":34266.519158999996,"text":"You can also consult the advice of governments other than your own. However, their advice is directed at their own citizens."},{"kind":"audio","t":34365.227388,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34371.800333,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34376.168953,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34378.201891,"samples":18096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"audio","t":34444.001766999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34449.158654,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34454.627947,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":34455.020691,"samples":7896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":45100.754467,"text":"Hong Kong adası Hong Kong bölgesine adını verir ve pek çok ziyaretçinin asıl odak noktası olarak değerlendirdiği yerdir."},{"kind":"text","t":45855.490601,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives its name to the Hong Kong region and is the place many visitors consider the main attraction."},{"kind":"audio","t":45958.296324999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45963.408743,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45969.031683,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":45973.710358,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":45979.183339999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45984.582254,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":45984.946127999996,"samples":8592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":59866.687235,"text":"Yüksek enlemlerde veya dağ geçitlerinde araç kullanacak olan herhangi bir kimse kar, buz veya donma ihtimalini göz önünde bulundurmalıdır."},{"kind":"text","t":60607.823876999995,"text":"Anyone driving in high latitudes or mountain passes should consider the possibility of snow, ice, or freezing conditions."},{"kind":"audio","t":60713.264318999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60718.503684999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60723.559374,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60728.941018,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60734.491218999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60740.06396,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60743.7916,"samples":27192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":66950.929193,"text":"Her nesilde iki havuz arasındaki ayrım ve yeniden birleşim varyasyonu ileri geri karıştırır."},{"kind":"text","t":67597.47511,"text":"The variation in separation and recombination between the two pools mixes back and forth with each generation."},{"kind":"audio","t":67698.64753999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67703.669739,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67708.928145,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67713.860476,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67719.20788,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67723.923025,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"input","t":76791.364906,"text":"Böcek terimi böcek bilinciler tarafından bu böcek türü için resmi şekilde kullanılır."},{"kind":"text","t":77433.28257699999,"text":"The term “insect” is officially used by insect consciousnesses for this species of insect."},{"kind":"audio","t":77531.759169,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77536.75134999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77542.362091,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77547.440841,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77550.762908,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":87751.552824,"text":"Her şeyden önce binicilerin büyük kısmı topuklu ve pürüzsüz gayet dar tabağını binici çizmesi giyer."},{"kind":"text","t":88481.400535,"text":"Above all, most riders wear riding boots with high heels, a smooth surface, and a very narrow sole."},{"kind":"audio","t":88582.57999299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":88587.596974,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":88592.690243,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":88598.041139,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":88603.456773,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":88605.759617,"samples":17960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":110},{"kind":"input","t":96841.609387,"text":"Martelli, Ekim ayında başlayan ve katılımın yüksek olduğu rejim karşıtı gösterilere bu komisyonla yanıt verdi."},{"kind":"text","t":97545.071245,"text":"Martelli responded to the anti-regime protests that began in October and saw high participation with this commission."},{"kind":"audio","t":97648.88632199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97654.0914,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97659.198269,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97664.841259,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":97669.912619,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97675.078037,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":97676.30499799999,"samples":12192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":102773.785242,"text":"İtfaiye ekipleri sonunda yangını gece 11.35'te söndürdü."},{"kind":"text","t":103388.586463,"text":"The fire crews finally extinguished the fire at 11:35 p.m."},{"kind":"audio","t":103487.86487199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103493.146388,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103494.550586,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103496.17569,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":103496.496425,"samples":6328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":109631.741817,"text":"Atlantik Kasırga mevsiminin isim verilen 10. fırtınası olan"},{"kind":"text","t":110070.18259899999,"text":"The 10th named storm of the Atlantic hurricane season"},{"kind":"audio","t":110153.377432,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110158.717158,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110163.192237,"samples":29264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":610},{"kind":"input","t":115632.35747999999,"text":"Jeri Alt tropik fırtınası bugün Atlantik okyanusunda ortaya çıktı."},{"kind":"text","t":116104.635656,"text":"Tropical Storm Jeri Alt formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"audio","t":116201.234837,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116206.214589,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116211.589104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":116212.906173,"samples":13296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":125429.610791,"text":"Bize treni, arabayı ve daha birçok ulaşım aracını getirdi."},{"kind":"text","t":125930.71286099999,"text":"It brought us trains, cars, and many other modes of transportation."},{"kind":"audio","t":126029.597647,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126034.649807,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126041.200063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126044.55675,"samples":25896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":139785.72735,"text":"M.S. 400 dolaylarında lüksün merkezi olarak ün kazandı ve bu şöhreti yaklaşık M.S. 1100 yılına kadar sürdürdü."},{"kind":"text","t":140681.04991200002,"text":"Around 400 AD, it became known as a center of luxury and maintained this reputation until around 1100 AD."},{"kind":"audio","t":140794.33603900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140799.738214,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140804.96540100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140810.025081,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140816.30937200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140821.49512,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140826.54653000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":140826.931473,"samples":12424,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":148288.20479100003,"text":"Ayın yüzeyi kayalardan ve tozdan oluşur. Ayın dış katmanına kabuk ismi verilir."},{"kind":"text","t":148829.71304200002,"text":"The surface of the moon is made up of rocks and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"audio","t":148916.42962,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148921.388551,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148925.88518,"samples":29264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"audio","t":149001.471494,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149006.79862000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149008.896826,"samples":18464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":156536.642632,"text":"ABD Mühendisler Birliği 6 inçlik yağışın daha önce sararı gören setleri aşabileceğine ihtimal vermiştir."},{"kind":"text","t":157262.044583,"text":"The American Society of Engineers has suggested that 6 inches of rainfall could overwhelm levees that were previously breached."},{"kind":"audio","t":157370.678644,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157375.72887400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":157380.862083,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":157386.23145800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157391.425935,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157396.683212,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157400.61688000002,"samples":27792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":165154.31116100002,"text":"Özellikle mikro ifadeleri doğru bir şekilde yorumlama yöntemiyle bir kişinin yalan söyleyip söylemediğinin anlaşılabileceği öne sürülüyor."},{"kind":"text","t":165768.55152100002,"text":"It is argued that a person’s honesty can be determined by accurately interpreting micro-expressions."},{"kind":"audio","t":165863.964141,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165869.0527,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165874.185499,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165879.54768400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165884.918489,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":165885.45917100002,"samples":9560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":171673.40496800002,"text":"Yapıları kazıyarak ya da duvar yazısı yazarak onlara saygısızlık etmeyin."},{"kind":"text","t":172259.445504,"text":"Do not show disrespect to them by digging up their structures or writing on their walls."},{"kind":"audio","t":172356.56693700003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172361.71442600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172366.55759900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":172371.76413700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172373.417481,"samples":15328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":182397.24054700002,"text":"Kaplanın kükremesi bir aslanın tam sesli kükremesi gibi değil, çok daha hırıltılı, bağıran sözlerle kurulan bir cümleyi andırıyor."},{"kind":"text","t":183357.24183500002,"text":"The tiger’s roar isn’t like a lion’s full-throated roar; it’s much more guttural, resembling a sentence built from shouting words."},{"kind":"audio","t":183448.760887,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":183456.11378,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":183460.434362,"samples":29864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":610},{"kind":"audio","t":183548.998411,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":183554.181068,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":183559.58856300003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":183562.25546100002,"samples":21696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":189793.45349400002,"text":"20. yüzyılda gerçekleştirilen araştırmalar iki farklı genetik varyasyon havuzu olduğunu göstermiştir."},{"kind":"text","t":190462.70833300002,"text":"Research conducted in the 20th century showed that there are two distinct pools of genetic variation."},{"kind":"audio","t":190553.02891400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":190554.32295300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":190555.82068,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":190557.39600500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190558.99874900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190559.411243,"samples":17960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":70},{"kind":"input","t":191950.524799,"text":"Gizli ve dışa vurulu."},{"kind":"text","t":192219.814537,"text":"Hidden and outwardly expressed."},{"kind":"audio","t":192310.90653600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192314.43228,"samples":29632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"close","t":202403.06283100002,"code":1005}]}